<title>USA: USA Detergents President Valdez resigns.</title>
<headline>USA Detergents President Valdez resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH BRUNSWICK, N.J. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Frank Valdez has resigned as president of USA Detergents Inc, the laundry and household cleaning products manufacturer said Tuesday.</p>
<p>USA Detergents said Valdez will remain as a consultant for the next six months.  </p>
<p>It said Uri Evan, the company's chairman and chief executive officer, will take over from Valdez until someone is found to replace him.</p>
<p>The company did not give a reason for his resignation and its spokesman was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
